Here some instructions and tricks
1) to run CCDY be sure you set    oldcode = .false. 
   in src/Sectors/mod_xsects_lo.f90

2) the process can be set via the configure file
   0 : Z boson
  -1 : W- exchange
  +1 : W+ exchange
  -----> this is set via the Vcharge flag
  -----> the analysis has to be set accordingly

  (?) whay to set automatically the correct analysis?  
